.title = "Recursively find recent files",
.date = "2024-01-01",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

The `walk` method recursively iterates a directory. This example filters `.smd` files while walking,
then uses `statFile()` to print files modified during the last 24 hours.

[]($code.siteAsset('src/01-04.zig').language('zig'))

The order of returned file system entries is undefined, if there are any requirements for the order in which to return the entries, such as alphabetical or chronological, sort them accordingly. Otherwise, leave them in their original, unsorted order.
